# The limestone caves' raw, the dripstone (GEAR.md §11), walked up to by name
# and looked at over the shoulder, under the ground. The surface raws are in
# tours/materials.tour.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/materials_caves.tour --seed=1 --realm=underground
# Options: --seed=1 --realm=underground
coast calm
near dripstone
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
wait 1.0
shot 01-dripstone with land:limestone_caves,prop:dripstone
press lamp
await lamp 5
wait 0.6
shot 02-dripstone-by-lamp with land:limestone_caves,prop:dripstone
release shoulder_peek
